ms it made it look  like it was just doing it because it was  edgy but it's there for a reason  and having now seen the reason yeah I  gotta say I respect this which  definitely off that first trailer I was  not expecting to so that's gonna wrap up  this one folks my thoughts on season 1  of titans have you seen it  what do you think about it whatever your  thoughts are drop them on down in the  comments let's talk about it whole bunch  of stuff to do down then there as well  all the buttons links patreon P o box  check them out and or don't that's okay  too because at the end of the day you're  the council I just run the meetings and  until next time this council is  adjourned  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

